WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.168
Prepare for battle!

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:06.256
Show them what Shoren marines are made of!

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:08.174
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.772
Yakitori versus mouse bombers?
Bring it, you morons!

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.442
Die, bastards!

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:35.201
They're small, but there are plenty
of weapons and ammo.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.536
Use what you want.

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:37.704
Nice.

